      "id": "COMMON_MESSAGE_653",
      "message_ID": 653,
      "speaker": "Shopkeeper",
      "context": "One alternative from the original Square shopkeeper trend conversation. The local trend state and random branch select the response.",
      "source_meaning": "The named good is selling extremely well right now.",
      "localization_note": "The brisk sales boast keeps the enthusiasm. Number-neutral wording avoids splitting the old hotcakes idiom and keeps the goods name together.",
