      "context": "One alternative from the original Square shopkeeper trend conversation. The local trend state and random branch select the response.",
      "source_meaning": "The shopkeeper wants to make a good profit before the trend fades and exclaims about being busy.",
      "localization_note": "Plenty of money and the flustered aside preserve both motives. The wording keeps the profit prospective and the busy aside personal.",
      "Japanese": "流行がすたれる前に\nしっかり儲けておかないと\nああ、忙しい",
      "english": "I'd better make plenty of money before this fad fades. Oh, there's so much to do!",
